#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"These functions calculate the complex arc cosine of I<z>.  If I<y\\ =\\ "
"cacos(z)>, then I<z\\ =\\ ccos(y)>.  The real part of I<y> is chosen in the "
"interval [0,pi]."
msgstr ""
"Эти функции вычисляют арккосинус комплексного числа I<z>. Если I<y\\ =\\ "
"cacos(z)>, то I<z\\ =\\ ccos(y)>. Реальная часть I<y> лежит в интервале [0,"
"pi]."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "One has:"
msgstr "Формула вычисления:"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "    cacos(z) = -i * clog(z + i * csqrt(1 - z * z))\n"
msgstr "    cacos(z) = -i * clog(z + i * csqrt(1 - z * z))\n"

